1 CONC birth may have lived at Bread Street. At marriage James was at Castle 
1 CONC Precincts, Bristol. Polled at St Philip and Jacob, Bristol in 1774, 1781 
1 CONC and 1784 at St Mary Redcliffe, Bristol.
